ng will to survive."}, {"versions": ["omega-ruby"], "text": "Corphish were originally foreign Pokémon that were imported as pets. They eventually turned up in the wild. This Pokémon is very hardy and has greatly increased its population."}, {"versions": ["alpha-sapphire"], "text": "Corphish catches prey with its sharp claws. It has no likes or dislikes when it comes to food—it will eat anything. This Pokémon has no trouble living in filthy water."}, {"versions": ["ultra-sun"], "text": "Individuals that have been set free by Trainers who could no longer raise them have become common, and they can now be found in Alola."}, {"versions": ["ultra-moon"], "text": "It can adapt very well to its environment. Feebas and Corphish are about the only Pokémon to live in stagnant ditches."}], "sprites_by_gen": {"generation-iii": {"emerald": {"normal": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/versions/generation-iii/emerald/341.png", "shiny": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/versions/generation-iii/emerald/shiny/341.png"}, "ruby-sapphire": {"normal": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/versions/generation-iii/ruby-sapphire/341.png", "shiny": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/versions/generation-iii/ruby-sapphire/shiny/341.png"}}, "generation-iv": {"diamond-pearl": {"normal": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/versions/generation-iv/diamond-pearl/341.png", "shiny": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/versions/generation-iv/diamond-pearl/shiny/341.png"}, "heartgold-soulsilver": {"normal": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/versions/generation-iv/heartgold-soulsilver/341.png", "shiny": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/versions/generation-iv/heartgold-soulsilver/shiny/341.png"}, "p